    <title>Daily Digest 2026-09-08: Cloud Native Computing Foundation Announces Karmad; Show HN: Archprint, infer architecture lint rules ; China Merchants Bank Wins CNCF End User Case Study</title>
    <updated>2026-09-08T00:00:00Z</updated>
    <link href="https://islandirie.github.io/my-rss-feed/daily/2026-09-08.html"/>
